# Dashboard — Design System Rules

Reference document: `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`

## Color — CSS Variables Only

```tsx
// ✅ Always reference design tokens — never hardcode hex values
<div style={{ color: 'var(--color-text-heading)' }} />
<div className="text-teal-600" />      // Tailwind mapped to #0891B2

// ❌ Never hardcode colors
<div style={{ color: '#0F172A' }} />
<div style={{ background: '#0891B2' }} />
```

## Typography — Strict Rules

```tsx
// ✅ Section labels — Inter 500, 12px, uppercase, tracking-widest
<p className="font-sans text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
  THIS WEEK
</p>

// ✅ Hero metric numbers — Inter 700, 48px, tabular-nums, -0.025em tracking
<p className="font-sans text-5xl font-bold tabular-nums text-slate-950 leading-tight"
   style={{ letterSpacing: '-0.025em', minWidth: '4ch' }}>
  {count}
</p>

// ✅ Card headings — Plus Jakarta Sans 600, 16px
<h3 className="font-display text-md font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-snug">
  Downloads Overview
</h3>

// ✅ Filenames and paths — JetBrains Mono 400
<span className="font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">
  resume_v3.pdf
</span>

// Rule: tabular-nums on EVERY number in the product without exception
// In Tailwind: className="tabular-nums"
```

## Glass Effects — Metric Cards & Charts

```tsx
// ✅ Metric card — use .card-metric-glass CSS class
<div className="card-metric-glass">
  {/* content */}
</div>

// ✅ Chart container — use .chart-glass CSS class
<div className="chart-glass">
  <p className="section-label">DOWNLOADS THIS WEEK</p>
  <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={200}>
    {/* Recharts component */}
  </ResponsiveContainer>
</div>

// ✅ Tailwind equivalent for metric card
<div className="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-[20px] border border-white/50 border-t-white/80 border-l-white/80 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-glass hover:-translate-y-[3px] hover:shadow-glass-hover transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-200 ease-out will-change-[transform,box-shadow]">

// ❌ Never apply glass to: nav, buttons, tooltips, modals, toasts, side panel shell
```

## Animations — Non-Negotiable Rules

```tsx
// ✅ ONLY animate transform and opacity — these are GPU-composited, zero layout impact
// transition-[transform,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] is safe

// ❌ NEVER animate width, height, margin, padding, top, left, right, bottom
// These trigger layout recalculation and WILL displace surrounding content

// ✅ Card hover — transform + box-shadow only
// Applied via .card-metric-glass and .chart-glass CSS classes automatically

// ✅ Skeleton shimmer — teal-tinted
<div className="skeleton" />   // via global CSS

// ✅ Count-up for all hero metrics
const count = useCountUp(metrics.weeklyDownloads, 800)
// ALWAYS pair with tabular-nums + minWidth: '4ch' to prevent layout shift

// ✅ Page transitions — opacity + translateY(8px) only
// Applied via CSS Transition Group or Framer Motion with transform/opacity only

// ✅ Milestone celebration (streak) — ease-spring, used ONLY for milestones
// Everything else uses ease-out

// Timing reference:
// Hover lift:        200ms ease-out
// Nav indicator:     250ms ease-smooth
// Page enter:        200ms ease-enter
// Page exit:         150ms ease-exit
// Toast:             300ms ease-spring
// Count-up:          800ms ease-out
// Streak milestone:  600ms ease-spring
```

## Recharts — Required Configuration

```tsx
import { CHART_COLORS, CHART_AXIS_STYLE, CHART_GRID_STYLE, CHART_TOOLTIP_STYLE }
  from '@/utils/chart-config'

// ✅ Always use shared config constants — never configure inline per chart
<CartesianGrid {...CHART_GRID_STYLE} vertical={false} />
<XAxis {...CHART_AXIS_STYLE} tickLine={false} axisLine={false} />
<Tooltip {...CHART_TOOLTIP_STYLE} />

// ✅ All chart lines use animationDuration={800} animationEasing="ease-out"
// ✅ All bars use radius={[4, 4, 0, 0]} (rounded top corners)
// ✅ All area charts use fillOpacity={0.12} with teal gradient fill
// ✅ Wrap every chart in .chart-glass container

// ✅ Recharts always inside ResponsiveContainer
<ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={200}>
  <LineChart data={data}>
    {/* ... */}
  </LineChart>
</ResponsiveContainer>

// ❌ Never set fixed pixel width on charts
<LineChart width={400} height={200} />
```

## Shadows — Always Teal-Tinted

```tsx
// ✅ Use shadow tokens — never custom shadow values
className="shadow-sm"            // resting cards (maps to --shadow-sm)
className="shadow-md"            // hovered cards
className="shadow-glass"         // glass metric cards and charts
className="shadow-glass-hover"   // hovered glass elements
className="shadow-primary"       // primary buttons only

// ❌ Never use Tailwind's default grey shadows
className="shadow"
className="shadow-lg"            // Tailwind default — grey, not teal-tinted
```

## Spacing — 8px Grid

```tsx
// ✅ All spacing values must be multiples of 8px
// p-1=4px  p-2=8px  p-3=12px  p-4=16px  p-6=24px  p-8=32px  p-12=48px  p-16=64px

// ✅ Always use gap between cards — never margin
<div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4">     // gap-4 = 16px ✅
  <MetricCard />
</div>

// ❌ Never use margin between sibling cards
<MetricCard className="mr-4" />              // gap instead
```

## Loading States — Skeleton Always, Spinner Never

```tsx
// ✅ Skeleton screens for data loading — matches the layout of content
if (isLoading) return <MetricCardSkeleton />

// ❌ Never a spinning indicator for page or card loads
if (isLoading) return <Spinner />

// ✅ Inline spinner ONLY for button loading state (< 1 second operations)
<button disabled={isPending}>
  {isPending ? <SpinnerIcon className="animate-spin" /> : 'Save'}
</button>
```
